FuckCode
-------------------------

FuckCode is a fork of 
* OpenCode: https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode 
for security auditing, penetration testing, 
reverse engineering, and infrastructure assessment


Install
-------------------------

Linux and macOS:
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoNFake/fuckcode/fuck-dev/install | bash

Windows PowerShell:
irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoNFake/fuckcode/fuck-dev/install.ps1 | iex


The installer fetches the release for your platform and puts `fuckcode` on `PATH`
(`--version <x.y.z>` pins a release, `--no-modify-path` leaves your shell config alone)


Run from source
-------------------------

From source, with 
* Bun: https://bun.sh

git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/NoNFake/fuckcode.git
cd fuckcode && bun install && bun dev


Upstream
-------------------------

FuckCode tracks: https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode 
and merges it regularly (`bun run sync`), 
then layers the security work on top. 
Upstream fixes and release features keep landing; 
the fork adds to the codebase instead of forking away
from it